  "notes": [
    "A hard-coded #2563EB (Tailwind v3 blue-600) appears 1 time(s) in the section (AddVendorPage) and #F8FAFC (v3 slate-50) 2 times; the v4 tokens are #155dfc and #f8fafc. TO CONFIRM: replace with bg-blue-600 / bg-slate-50.",
    "text-muted (slate-400) fails 4.5:1 on white and slate-50; it is used for \"no expiry\", empty dashes and some 10 px labels. Recommended fix: use slate-500 for any text.",
    "The section adds a violet accent family for everything to do with signing (forms block, sign-form, Sign & confirm, Both chips); it is not used elsewhere in the app.",
    "Some components mix the red and rose families for errors/danger, and green with emerald for success; the tokens above pick one family per role."
  ],
